<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "1. In mothers with long QT syndrome, a beta blocker should be continued during pregnancy and throughout the postpartum period including in women who are breastfeeding (S10.2-1)." .
