<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "2. In the pregnant patient with sustained VA, electrical cardioversion is safe and effective and should be used with standard electrode configuration (S10.2-2,S10.2-3)." .
